      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Chain 90. Row 1: dc in 2nd ch and each ch to end (90 dc)." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Broomstick lace" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Loop row: draw up a loop from each stitch onto the dowel (90 loops). Petal row: slide 5 loops off, ch 1, work 5 dc through the centre; repeat across (18 clusters). Repeat loop and petal rows until the blanket is 70 cm long." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Border and finishing" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Work 1 round of dc evenly around all four edges, working 3 dc into each corner. Fasten off and weave in the ends with the tapestry needle." }]
